OL,3,GNEWSAPoll scopes interest in
OL,4,Ainter-island car ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders are being polled on their
OL,7,Flevel of interest in a regular vehicle
OL,8,Fferry service to run between Jersey and
OL,9,FGuernsey.
OL,11,FIslands Unlimited began its foot
OL,12,Fpassenger sailings between the islands
OL,13,Fin 2025.
OL,15,FThere is currently only one sailing for
OL,16,Fcars a week between the islands - on a
OL,17,FWednesday - and run by Brittany
OL,18,FFerries.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
